[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ARI-001
VERSION: 1
TITLE: Addition
STATEMENT: >>>
When the service receives a valid addition request, the service **shall**
return the exact sum `a + b`.
<<<
KIND: functional
STATUS: draft
PRIORITY: high
SAFETY: QM
RELEASE: 1.0.0
VERIFICATION: test
VERIF_LEVELS: unit, system
